## Quick Start

### 1. Download / Clone TraceFinder
```cmd
git clone https://github.com/Iddrriss/Trace-finder.git
cd Trace-finder
```

### 2. Verify Python Installation
```cmd
python --version
# Should show: Python 3.8.x or higher
```

### 3. Run TraceFinder
```cmd
# Run as Administrator (recommended for full functionality)
python tracefinder.py
```

