## Usage Examples

### Basic Usage (Default 180-minute window, CSV export)
```cmd
python tracefinder.py
```

### Custom Time Window
```cmd
# Last 30 minutes
python tracefinder.py 30
# or
python tracefinder.py -w 30

# Last 6 hours
python tracefinder.py -w 360

# Last 24 hours
python tracefinder.py -w 1440
```

### JSON and Multi-Format Export
```cmd
# Export only to JSON
python tracefinder.py -f json

# Export to both CSV and JSON with custom prefix 'case_incident_404'
python tracefinder.py -f both -o case_incident_404
```

### Non-Interactive / Scripting Mode
```cmd
# Automatically continue if not admin, suppress wide table, export both formats
python tracefinder.py --yes --quiet -f both
```

